          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 73310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist die maximale Anzahl von Werten, die ein Array halten kann?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Soviel wir wollen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Soviel wir wollen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Playlist-Array wächst von 3 auf 12 Songs. Kann dasselbe Array alle 12 enthalten?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ja, ein Array kann so viele Werte enthalten, wie wir benötigen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nein, ein Array kann nur einen Wert enthalten</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nein, ein Array nimmt nach dem zehnten keine Werte mehr an</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ja, aber erst nachdem die ursprünglichen drei Songs ersetzt wurden</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ja, ein Array kann so viele Werte enthalten, wie wir benötigen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element",
            "id": 73903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist ein Element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ein Wert in einem Array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Der Zustand eines Arrays</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ein Wert in einem Array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Option ist in <code>const scores = [8, 10, 9]</code> ein Element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Wert <code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Das gesamte Array <code>[8, 10, 9]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Der Index, mit dem <code>10</code> gefunden wird</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Der Variablenname <code>scores</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Der Wert <code>10</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Value in an array",
            "id": 73269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Weise dem <code>toDo</code>-Array den Wert <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> zu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;To Do:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Feed Darian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"To Do:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Feed Clawdius' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> und schließlich <code>]</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 73271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle ein Array, das <code>\"classic\"</code> und <code>\"dark mode\"</code> speichert.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[</code>, gefolgt von <code>]</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle ein Array, das <code>\"classic\"</code> und <code>\"dark mode\"</code> speichert.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"theme\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"styles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"modes\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>themes</code>, gefolgt von <code>[</code> und schließlich <code>]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Empty array",
            "id": 73313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ shoppingList ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[]</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stell dir vor, du fügst vor der Ausgabe mit <code>.push()</code> <code>\"milk\"</code> hinzu. Was zeigt die Konsole?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[ \"milk\" ]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\", \"milk\" ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[ \"milk\" ]</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Start at zero",
            "id": 73926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Index von <code>\"lightBlue\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>0</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Ausdruck ruft <code>\"lightBlue\"</code> aus <code>colorScheme</code> ab?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colorScheme[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[-1]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>colorScheme[0]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Change value",
            "id": 73974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aktualisiere das zweite Element auf <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" missedCalls = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lou&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Zoe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"missedCalls[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(missedCalls);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"missedCalls[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Robert&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Lou', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>missedCalls[1]</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code> und schließlich <code>\"Lee\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 73931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen letzten Index können wir in diesem Array zugreifen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Array hat drei Lieferwerte und die Indizierung beginnt bei <code>0</code>. Welcher letzte Index ist gültig?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code>, der Index des dritten Werts</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, weil das Array drei Werte hat</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, weil der letzte Wert <code>true</code> ist</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, weil nur die Werte <code>false</code> zählen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code>, der Index des dritten Werts.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Start at zero",
            "id": 73980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code <code>\"Meg\"</code> an Index <code>0</code> und <code>\"Max\"</code> an Index <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Meg\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Max\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code <code>\"Meg\"</code> an Index <code>0</code> und <code>\"Max\"</code> an Index <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shift\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Meg\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Max\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 73925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie greifen wir auf den Wert <code>22</code> in diesem Array zu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Wert <code>22</code> steht in <code>bingoAnswer</code> an dritter Stelle. Welcher Ausdruck ruft ihn ab?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[22]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 74092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es entfernt den letzten Wert eines Arrays</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es entfernt den ersten Wert eines Arrays</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es entfernt einen zufälligen Wert aus einem Array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es entfernt den letzten Wert eines Arrays.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du rufst <code>tasks.pop()</code> für <code>[\"email\", \"call\", \"meeting\"]</code> auf. Was geschieht?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"meeting\"</code> wird entfernt und zurückgegeben</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"email\"</code> wird entfernt und zurückgegeben</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eine der drei Aufgaben wird zufällig entfernt</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code> wird zurückgegeben und alle drei Aufgaben bleiben erhalten</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"meeting\"</code> wird entfernt und zurückgegeben.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 74095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es fügt einem Array einen Wert hinzu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es entfernt einen Wert aus einem Array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es erstellt ein Array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es fügt einem Array einen Wert hinzu.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was geschieht nach <code>forecast.push(\"windy\")</code> mit <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es wird zu <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es wird zu <code>[\"sunny\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es wird ein separates Array <code>[\"windy\"]</code> erstellt</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Es wird zu <code>[\"windy\", \"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es wird zu <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 74090,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge <code>\"windy\"</code> zu diesem Wettervorhersage-Array hinzu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(forecast);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sunny', 'cloudy', 'windy' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>forecast</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>push</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 74094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Index von <code>\"salami\"</code> im Array, nachdem es mit <code>push()</code> hinzugefügt wurde?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Index ruft nach dem gezeigten <code>push()</code> den Wert <code>\"salami\"</code> ab?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>toppings.push[1]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 74091,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Wert von <code>digit</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Ergebnis beschreibt nach dem gezeigten <code>pop()</code> <code>digit</code> und <code>doorCode</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">digit ist 1 und doorCode ist [2, 5, 0, 0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">digit ist 1 und doorCode ist [2, 5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">digit ist 1 und doorCode ist [5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">digit ist 0 und doorCode ist [2, 5, 0, 1]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">digit ist 1 und doorCode ist [2, 5, 0, 0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
